<title>UK: Bayer unit sets $250 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer unit sets $250 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYER CORP PITTSBURG</p>
<p>SUPPORT AGREEMENT FROM BAYER AG</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    01.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.87    PAY DATE    01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.745    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    *YES	CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY 6.75 PCT DUE AUG 2001</p>
<p> NOTES	*ISSUER ONLY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
